Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.79,0:00:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.08,0:00:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.58,0:00:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Horimiya"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.04,0:02:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Student Council Room"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.62,0:02:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Student Council Room"\N"Everybody Loves Somebody"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.20,0:02:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Student Council Room"\N"Everybody Loves Somebody"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.20,0:02:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Two, four, six, eight...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.54,0:02:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Everybody Loves Somebody"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.54,0:02:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Two, four, six, eight...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.79,0:02:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Two, four, six, eight...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.50,0:02:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for picking these up for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.70,0:02:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be tough handling everything by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.79,0:02:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't do it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.79,0:02:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Remi and Sengoku-kun handle\Nthe things they're able to handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.33,0:02:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Remi always opens this window for us,\Nso we get this nice breeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.16,0:02:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's kind of cool how you work this hard,\Neven when nobody's looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.45,0:02:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you talking about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.95,0:02:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.16,0:02:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You good with those papers?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.91,0:02:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Yeah, I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.75,0:02:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the help, Ishikawa-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.16,0:02:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.58,0:02:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.00,0:02:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We were supposed to head\Nhome together, but you didn't show.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.75,0:02:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So Hori-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.54,0:02:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, you must be dying of heat!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.83,0:03:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Promise me you'll take your\Njacket off when you walk home!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.95,0:03:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, I got some frozen treats.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.70,0:03:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Have one with Toru when he gets here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.20,0:03:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,...gave me these. Apparently they were half off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.12,0:03:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I see, they're from Hori.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.20,0:03:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Juicy Melon"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.20,0:03:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I see, they're from Hori.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.70,0:03:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Juicy Melon"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.70,0:03:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,How nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.79,0:03:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't {\i1}have {\i0}melon, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.08,0:03:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.62,0:03:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.62,0:03:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Juicy Melon"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.33,0:03:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This {\i0}is what you stopped me for?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.54,0:03:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I can't eat two...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.79,0:03:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm your garbage disposal?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.41,0:03:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.16,0:03:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Miyamura-kun, your tongue's turned white.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.08,0:03:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe 'cause I'm eating this popsicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.08,0:03:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.91,0:03:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it's green! Like, super green!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.70,0:03:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad {\i1}you two {\i0}are enjoying this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.75,0:03:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet I'm the only one who didn't get anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.83,0:03:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Ishikawa-kun, your tongue's kind of long.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.70,0:03:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.54,0:03:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It {\i1}is {\i0}long. Like a snake's.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.25,0:03:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to tell Remi\Nand Sakura about it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.58,0:04:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.16,0:04:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's Sakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.58,0:04:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sakura Kono. She's on the\Nstudent council with Remi and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.79,0:04:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the nerdy-looking girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.50,0:04:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't call her that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.87,0:04:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, there are\Na lot of girls on the council.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.37,0:04:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sengoku's harem.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.41,0:04:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey{\i0}! It's strictly business!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.16,0:04:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You get to use the A/C in the\Ncouncil room as much as you want...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.66,0:04:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a spoiled king.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.62,0:04:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You have {\i1}that {\i0}much power, Prez?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.37,0:04:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make me out to be some villain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.16,0:04:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Though, yes, the A/C is a special privilege.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.50,0:04:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You can swing by the student\Ncouncil to cool off any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.37,0:04:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.91,0:04:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.54,0:04:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Student Council Room"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.83,0:04:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Student Council Room"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.83,0:04:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Rock, paper, scissors!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.54,0:04:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Rock, paper, scissors!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.04,0:04:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, I lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.91,0:04:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san and Mimyamura-kun have to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.58,0:04:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They swung by... and brought friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.62,0:04:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oolong tea, orange juice, a cola... what else?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.66,0:04:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Strawberry milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.70,0:05:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are Hori-san and\NMiyamura-{\i1}kun really {\i0}not dating?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.04,0:05:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.41,0:05:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.87,0:05:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like Ishikawa-kun would be\Na {\i1}way {\i0}better match for Hori-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.66,0:05:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Wait, really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.33,0:05:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut it out. He {\i1}just {\i0}gave up on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.91,0:05:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishikawa-kun has a crush on Hori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.08,0:05:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sounds like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.83,0:05:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If you really want to be with Kyo-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.58,0:05:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,you'd better be one hell of a masochist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.83,0:05:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what? Why? Where's this coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.41,0:05:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishikawa-kun has a crush on Hori-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.45,0:05:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap, the cola!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.70,0:05:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Who wanted that again?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.87,0:05:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,They sure are taking their time getting drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.75,0:05:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonder what they're up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.33,0:05:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mean, like, they're\Ndoing anything weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.37,0:06:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. What could they get up to\Nin the middle of the day at school?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.25,0:06:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So... what {\i1}are {\i0}they up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.33,0:06:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Sheesh, get it together!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.45,0:06:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.29,0:06:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,See, look what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.33,0:06:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have put it that way...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.87,0:06:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I bet Miyamura just\Ndropped the change or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.16,0:06:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Psychic"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.16,0:06:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I bet Miyamura just\Ndropped the change or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.29,0:06:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I bet Miyamura just\Ndropped the change or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.66,0:06:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshikawa's kindness deserves to\Nbe put in the class log for posterity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.50,0:06:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Good thing I'm class leader today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.12,0:06:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fill the classroom log with useless crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.83,0:06:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop messing around with my hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.29,0:06:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Messing around...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.41,0:06:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, sorry for the wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.54,0:06:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We would've been back sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.41,0:06:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, thanks! Got my cola?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.66,0:06:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.58,0:06:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.29,0:06:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori screwed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.62,0:06:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry to do\Nthis to you, Ishikawa-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.37,0:06:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,--Stop! I don't want to hear it! Please, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.50,0:06:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,--Wait, what?\N--Stop! I don't want to hear it! Please, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.08,0:06:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,--What happened?\N--Stop! I don't want to hear it! Please, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.04,0:06:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He was holding Toru's soda when...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.83,0:06:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, damn, that really sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.54,0:07:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were you, I'd be going after\Nthe guy who did me like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.16,0:07:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Sengoku-kun!\NThat's how a real man handles it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.04,0:07:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.33,0:07:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshikawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.50,0:07:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got a bunch of pens, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.83,0:07:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you stab me in the arm with one?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.00,0:07:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Why? Just cause you\Ngot screwed out of a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.70,0:07:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, c'mon, Ishikawa-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.91,0:07:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to. It, like, just... happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.33,0:07:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, one thing lead to another.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.54,0:07:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I should've tried to stop it before it happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.16,0:07:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,but the deed is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.79,0:07:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What's done is done! It's all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.37,0:07:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's not good at all{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.16,0:07:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, c'mon, it's just a soda.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.29,0:07:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait... soda?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.91,0:07:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why's it exploding?! Dammit, Miyamura!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.91,0:07:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My hands are all sticky...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.45,0:07:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,--Now we gotta clean the floor. Got any rags?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.87,0:07:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,--Miyamura-kun dropped your soda.\N--Now we gotta clean the floor. Got any rags?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.08,0:07:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, is that all? I got all worried for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.83,0:07:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.83,0:07:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Kono-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.70,0:08:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.08,0:08:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry the A/C's broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.62,0:08:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, I don't mind the heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.16,0:08:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Though at night, I'll sleep without clothes on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.41,0:08:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, I should just study in the\Nstudent council room next time...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.20,0:08:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you sleep naked?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.58,0:08:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?! I mean, I wear underwear!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.12,0:08:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I just thought that was normal... Shoot...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.87,0:08:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, he doesn't\Nget embarrassed about undressing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.20,0:08:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, was I supposed to get\Nembarrassed when he undressed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.95,0:08:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, just thinking about it\Nmakes me feel embarrassed...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.33,0:08:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Miyamura, can I see your tattoos?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.70,0:08:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.41,0:08:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't start stripping!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.50,0:08:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.58,0:08:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All I asked was to see them\Nand you just start stripping?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.00,0:08:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't even ask why,\Nyou just stripped! You're scaring me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.62,0:09:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Your shouting is way scarier, Hori-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.91,0:09:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just cool with\Nstripping in front of people?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.20,0:09:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? I mean, you know what it looks like, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.16,0:09:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What about if you stripped in front of Toru?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.75,0:09:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, but he knows\Nabout the tattoos and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.04,0:09:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If Toru stripped in front of you,\Nwould you get flustered?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.25,0:09:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it depends on the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.54,0:09:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So that means--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.37,0:09:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.25,0:09:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Hori-san.\NWhy are you asking me all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.54,0:09:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,'Cause you don't seem to\Nget flustered about anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.41,0:09:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I was wondering what {\i1}would {\i0}get you flustered.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.16,0:09:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, I haven't really seen\Nyou get embarrassed or blush...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.66,0:09:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm always the one\Nfreaking out about stuff, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.66,0:09:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I blush super easily...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.08,0:09:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.62,0:09:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God! He's totally creeped out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.00,0:09:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, was I supposed to be embarrassed just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.70,0:09:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's try it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.20,0:10:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the point?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.79,0:10:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, something's off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.25,0:10:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it {\i1}is {\i0}hot.\NGoing shirtless would feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.08,0:10:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So you {\i1}are {\i0}hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.83,0:10:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hori-san, do you really think\NI've never gotten flustered, ever?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.70,0:10:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Well, kind of. Like a teeny bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.70,0:10:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,S-So not long ago, I ran into\Na friend from middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.95,0:10:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,A friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.75,0:10:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.83,0:10:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Shindo?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.04,0:10:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, man, I'm jealous!\NYou're finally growin' up on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.20,0:10:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.79,0:10:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't play coy with me, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.12,0:10:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean me being a senior in high school now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.33,0:10:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Heard you missed too\Nmany days and got held back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.50,0:10:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Got Held Back"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.50,0:10:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Heard you missed too\Nmany days and got held back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.87,0:10:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Got Held Back"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.58,0:10:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what I mean, you moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.66,0:10:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about that girlfriend\Nyou're always walking around with!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.50,0:10:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?! Sh-She's not my girlfriend!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.16,0:10:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, like I believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.12,0:11:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mind the joke, but Hori-san would.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.91,0:11:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So her name's Hori-san, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.16,0:11:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't call your\Ngirlfriend by her first name?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.16,0:11:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I totally do...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.79,0:11:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I blurted it out in the moment...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.20,0:11:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.37,0:11:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry. I thought I'd be fine with\Nhim thinking you're my girlfriend,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.91,0:11:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,but it still got me all flustered...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.45,0:11:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, but don't worry, I'll tell him\Nright now that we're not dating.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.54,0:11:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.79,0:11:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you don't have to tell him we aren't...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.00,0:11:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak of the devil! It's my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.79,0:11:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He just texted me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.66,0:11:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that look for?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.54,0:11:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, he sent a picture. Lemme see!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.66,0:11:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, I wanna see!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.45,0:11:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,One moment, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.66,0:11:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get all polite on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.25,0:11:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.00,0:11:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"I got me a girlfriend! Cute, isn't she? I told her\Nwe're gonna do a double date sometime!\NDon't forget to use protection, wink wink!"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.00,0:11:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that moron thinking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.29,0:11:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"I got me a girlfriend! Cute, isn't she? I told her\Nwe're gonna do a double date sometime!\NDon't forget to use protection, wink wink!"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.29,0:11:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,--C'mon. Are you listening? C'mon, Miyamura...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.50,0:11:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Don't forget to use protection, wink wink!"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.50,0:11:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,--C'mon. Are you listening? C'mon, Miyamura...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.79,0:11:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,--Like hell I'm letting you see {\i1}that{\i0}!\N--C'mon. Are you listening? C'mon, Miyamura...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.75,0:11:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Volume!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.45,0:12:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Aaaand delete.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.41,0:12:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen you this\Nworked up before, Miyamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.37,0:12:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, no, it's just 'cause he's such a moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.45,0:12:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,--Like, for real...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.70,0:12:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,--Hello? Oh, sup, Miyamura?\N--Like, for real...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.29,0:12:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,--Hello? Oh, sup, Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.08,0:12:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Piss off{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.16,0:12:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that how you always talk to\Nyour friends from middle school?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.79,0:12:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Kinda.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.79,0:12:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought Miyamura was the\Nkind of guy who never god mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.91,0:12:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you try that\Nkind of reaction with Toru?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.70,0:12:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe once we get to be better friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.75,0:12:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He's shy about the weirdest stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.54,0:12:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are pretty good friends\Nalready though, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.75,0:12:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You really think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.00,0:12:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.95,0:12:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,There's so much I don't know about Miyamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.83,0:12:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what he was like in middle school...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.54,0:12:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmkay, I got that, and that...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.29,0:12:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I coming down with a cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.50,0:12:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it because I blasted\Nthe A/C after it was fixed?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.87,0:13:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,--No way, only morons catch colds\Nin the summer. I can't be sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.29,0:13:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,--Hey, Hori-san!\N--No way, only morons catch colds\Nin the summer. I can't be sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.00,0:13:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Who're you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.91,0:13:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, their new song's out?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.20,0:13:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I borrowed the CD from Shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.87,0:13:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently it came out last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.50,0:13:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll ask to borrow it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.87,0:13:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The vocals are awesome...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.08,0:13:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Isn't that Hori?\NIs that guy hitting on her?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.62,0:13:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Hori-sa...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.79,0:13:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hori--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.37,0:13:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing, Shindo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.95,0:13:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,--Hey, Miyamura! What a coinkidink!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.50,0:13:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,--He punched him without a second thought!\N--Hey, Miyamura! What a coinkidink!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.33,0:13:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.04,0:13:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been your friend for forever!\NYou should at least introduce me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.25,0:13:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Koichi Shindo, second year,\Nwent to my school. There.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.66,0:13:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like how you'd find him on Google...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.91,0:13:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You know this guy, Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.16,0:13:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.83,0:13:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You just said he went to your school.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.58,0:13:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, {\i1}second {\i0}year?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.25,0:13:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup. I'm repeating the grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.25,0:13:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So he's...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.25,0:13:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,An idiot. It's 'cause he's stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.33,0:13:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I'm at Yasaka! You're so mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.08,0:14:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,"Hasaka High = Best School in the City\NAKA Pachi High."\NYeah, but I'm at Yasaka! You're so mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.66,0:14:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,"Hasaka High = Best School in the City\NAKA Pachi High."\NPachi High?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.58,0:14:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Pachi High?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.95,0:14:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Still wish I could've gone to Katagiri with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.25,0:14:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.41,0:14:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,'Cause you seem to be having a good time there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.79,0:14:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Though maybe 'cause of your girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.16,0:14:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, we're not like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.25,0:14:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, don't be shy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.87,0:14:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.83,0:14:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, if we're gonna stop and chat,\Ncan we do it somewhere with A/C?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.41,0:14:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Why don't we hit up a restaurant, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.45,0:14:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Shindo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.16,0:14:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, crap, that's the bell. We gotta\Nchange classrooms, right? Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.33,0:14:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold up, Shindo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.79,0:14:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap, I forgot my notebook. Go on without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.29,0:14:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You gonna go to class?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.29,0:14:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It starts in two minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.87,0:15:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sheesh, at least pick up your stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.29,0:15:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.04,0:15:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Uhh, Yamamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.08,0:15:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Not my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.20,0:15:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.79,0:15:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.00,0:15:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry! Your name's Yamamoto, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.70,0:15:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're getting even colder.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.20,0:15:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Just kidding, Yamakawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.16,0:15:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,"Yama" isn't in my name!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.95,0:15:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Kawada!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.79,0:15:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're just trying all\Nthe "Kawa" names! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.25,0:15:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,--I haven't talked to a classmate\Nor raised my voice in so long...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.41,0:15:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,--Wait, was there a "hashi" in your name?\N--I haven't talked to a classmate\Nor raised my voice in so long...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.37,0:15:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,--{\i1}No{\i0}!\N--I haven't talked to a classmate\Nor raised my voice in so long...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.95,0:15:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,...that it feels weird to be doing it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.37,0:15:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.91,0:15:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I was drinking that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.58,0:15:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, lemme have a sip.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.29,0:15:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, did you catch the concert\Non TV last night? The Osaka one!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.04,0:15:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I did! It was awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.37,0:16:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Right? The lighting and stuff were so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.70,0:16:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna go to a concert someday...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.37,0:16:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Shindo, you've been hanging out\Nwith Miyamura a lot lately, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.75,0:16:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.20,0:16:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You should probably stop, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.70,0:16:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He's all gloomy and depressing.\NAnd he has tons of piercings and shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.58,0:16:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.83,0:16:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,When that kind of guy loses his temper,\Nit's bad news for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.70,0:16:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Shindo, you gotta--
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.00,0:16:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you think made him get that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.75,0:16:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you guys are just mad\N'cause you think he stole me from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.83,0:16:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, we'll hang out again sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.50,0:16:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,--Shindo changed my whole\Nmiddle school experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.87,0:16:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,--Do you know about the new place\Nthat opened up over here?\N--Shindo changed my whole\Nmiddle school experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.00,0:16:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,--Yeah, though I haven't been yet.\N--Shindo changed my whole\Nmiddle school experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.00,0:16:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are paying, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.50,0:16:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,--What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.87,0:17:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,--And the person who's changed\Nmy high school experience...\N--What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.66,0:17:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,--And the person who's changed\Nmy high school experience...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.83,0:17:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem to be having a good time there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.29,0:17:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Miyamura!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.54,0:17:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,...has got to be Hori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.29,0:17:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Your fever's really high!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.75,0:17:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And Mom already went to work...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.45,0:17:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.79,0:17:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Where're you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.54,0:17:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,School.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.54,0:17:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But you have a fever! You should rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.70,0:17:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't be sick. Only morons\Ncatch colds in the summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.12,0:17:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So I can't have a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.62,0:17:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You totally do, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.75,0:17:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta g...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.12,0:17:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Sota.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.20,0:17:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna stay home and rest today!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.12,0:17:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta go to school,\Nso don't die while I'm gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.08,0:17:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna die. Have a good day at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.20,0:17:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, feel better!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.66,0:17:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Sota sure is growing up quick...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.75,0:18:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyoko...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.70,0:18:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, Kyoko,\Nbut there's an emergency at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.70,0:18:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could stay, but I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.70,0:18:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.33,0:18:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, my nose is all stuffed up...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.91,0:18:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san, do you need a towel?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.95,0:18:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.50,0:18:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No prob.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.70,0:18:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me know when you need a dry one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.08,0:18:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I also brought you a sports drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.91,0:18:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I hallucinating? Why're you here, Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.29,0:18:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.50,0:18:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sota called me this morning saying\Nyou "might die," so I swung by.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.83,0:18:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Cold Meds"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.83,0:18:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sota called me this morning saying\Nyou "might die," so I swung by.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.33,0:18:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sota called me this morning saying\Nyou "might die," so I swung by.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.33,0:18:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.16,0:19:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get dressed for school\Nthis morning? How high's your fever?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.62,0:19:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirty-ei...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.45,0:19:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirty, uh, {\i1}seven{\i0}... around there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.66,0:19:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you take any cold meds?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.12,0:19:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, not long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.83,0:19:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay then. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.00,0:19:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You should change out of your uniform...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.83,0:19:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.87,0:19:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait... what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.87,0:19:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.29,0:19:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.66,0:19:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Uh, to get you a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.54,0:19:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.41,0:19:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san, for real, though,\Nyou should go lie down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.58,0:19:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Where... are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.12,0:19:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyoko, you're always so\Ngood at toughing things out...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.37,0:19:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I shouldn't take\Nadvantage of that. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.70,0:20:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. Dad's not around right\Nnow, and work's rough on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.16,0:20:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a little kid anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.37,0:20:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.00,0:20:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a good day at work, Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.91,0:20:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.04,0:20:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you never, ever, {\i1}ever {\i0}here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.16,0:20:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.91,0:20:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san, instead of "where are you going,"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.79,0:20:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,do you mean, "please don't go"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.00,0:20:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.41,0:20:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.25,0:20:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Until you say you don't need me here anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.50,0:20:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,or get sick and tired of looking at my face,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.29,0:20:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,or tell me to buzz off,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.45,0:20:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to stay right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.41,0:21:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.70,0:21:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure you drink some\Nwater later though, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.62,0:21:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm heading out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.54,0:21:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I called your mom and told\NIshikawa-kun to tell school you're sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.33,0:21:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Also,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.79,0:21:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in love with you, Hori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.20,0:21:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Have been for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.45,0:21:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There're drinks and food in the fridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.50,0:21:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If you need anything, call or\Ntext me. I'll come right over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.33,0:21:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What? {\i1}What {\i0}did he just say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.79,0:21:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so shocked, my fever's\Npractically disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.58,0:22:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? Why'd he tell me in the\Nmiddle of all that boring stuff!?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.29,0:22:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He knew I was awake\Nwhen he said all that, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.50,0:22:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it. I need to know if he said it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.87,0:22:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't want to make him say it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.83,0:22:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.54,0:22:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,If I pretend I didn't hear it,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.37,0:22:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,maybe we can stay like this\Nfor a little while longer...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.58,0:23:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"I Can't Say It Out Loud"
